	"description" : "Customizable neon sunset. Lots of custom shaders.\r\n\r\n- Customizable colors for everything.\r\n- Infinite scrolling terrain.\r\n- VHS noise and glitch effects.\r\n\r\n[h1]UPDATED 31-10-2018\r\nYou need the last version of Wallpaper Engine or this wallpaper won't work right so if you have issues, make sure Steam updated the program.[/h1]\r\nThe update added sliders for the amount of noise, height of the terrain and flat shading. There's also a new horizon effect and you can change its glow color separately from the clouds.\r\n\r\n[h1]UPDATED 02-11-2018[/h1]\r\nBetter procedural texture filtering. Less flickering on flat ground, sharper lines on high ground in the distance.\r\n\r\nProject files (02-11-2018): https://drive.google.com/open?id=1HyrfbGOs4JWB-4okP3uq9c9Xz7KoUbHA (already uses new sliders, so it won't fully work without the program being updated.)",
